{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05807","headline":"奉和圣制荅张说南出雀鼠谷 · 崔翘","name":"奉和圣制荅张说南出雀鼠谷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"硖路绕河汾，晴光拂曙氛。\n笳吟中岭树，仗入半峰云。\n顿觉山原尽，平看邑里分。\n早行芳草迥，晚憩好风熏。\n嘉颂推英宰，春游扈圣君。\n共欣承睿渥，日月照天文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔翘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}